  "en": "ALERT: The rains reached Garissa on the night of Thursday 12 November. 2 mm fell on Garissa in the last 3 days (30 mm on 13 Nov). The River Tana is steady – flow is 4.5× its dry early-October level. Indicative Garissa gauge ~4.25 m now, ~4.25 m by 28 Nov (wettest run 5.01 m).",
  "sw": "ALERT: Mvua zilifika Garissa usiku wa Alhamisi 12 Novemba. Mvua ya mm 2 imenyesha Garissa siku 3 zilizopita. Mto Tana unazidi kupanda – kiwango cha kipimo cha Garissa kinakadiriwa mita 4.25 sasa na mita 4.25 kufikia 28 Nov.",
  "so": "ALERT: Roobabku waxay gaareen Garissa habeenkii Khamiista 12 Nofeembar. 2 mm roob ah ayaa ka da'ay Garissa 3dii maalmood ee la soo dhaafay. Webiga Tana wuu sii kacayaa – cabbirka Garissa qiyaastii 4.25 m hadda, 4.25 m ilaa 28 Nov."
